            "text": "theorem coreVelocity_norm_at_origin {h j Λ : ℝ} {P0 a0 : ℝ → ℝ}\n    {f U V Pr : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ} (hh : 0 < h) (hh1 : h < 1 / 2) (hj : 0 < j)\n    (hs : NaturalProfile.IsNaturalSolution h j Λ P0 a0 f U V Pr)\n    {t : ℝ} (ht : t < 1) :\n    ‖coreVelocity h f V (t, 0)‖ = (1 - t) ^ (-NaturalAxisData.A h) * j"
